From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RDK <rdk@comcast.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] opentelemetry: link only targets available in
 opentelemetry-cpp 1.23.0

The OpenTelemetry extension over-links the exporter *_builder factory
targets and the generic http_client target, which only exist in
opentelemetry-cpp 1.24+/1.28+. The extension code uses the classic
exporter Factory classes (OtlpHttpExporterFactory,
OStreamSpanExporterFactory, ...) provided by the base exporter
libraries, so these targets are never referenced. Drop them so the
extension configures and links against opentelemetry-cpp 1.23.0.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [rdk-specific opentelemetry-cpp version pin]
---
 Source/extensions/opentelemetry/CMakeLists.txt | 6 ------
 1 file changed, 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Source/extensions/opentelemetry/CMakeLists.txt b/Source/extensions/opentelemetry/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/Source/extensions/opentelemetry/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/Source/extensions/opentelemetry/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -49,18 +49,12 @@
         CompileSettings::CompileSettings
         CompileSettingsDebug::CompileSettingsDebug
         opentelemetry-cpp::ostream_span_exporter
-        opentelemetry-cpp::ostream_span_exporter_builder
         opentelemetry-cpp::ostream_log_record_exporter
         opentelemetry-cpp::otlp_http_exporter
-        opentelemetry-cpp::otlp_http_exporter_builder
         opentelemetry-cpp::otlp_http_log_record_exporter
-        opentelemetry-cpp::otlp_http_log_record_exporter_builder
         opentelemetry-cpp::otlp_http_metric_exporter
-        opentelemetry-cpp::otlp_http_metric_exporter_builder
         opentelemetry-cpp::ostream_metrics_exporter
-        opentelemetry-cpp::ostream_metrics_exporter_builder
         opentelemetry-cpp::http_client_curl
-        opentelemetry-cpp::http_client
 )
 
  set_target_properties(${TARGET} PROPERTIES
